		(property "Note" "PROVISIONAL - machine harness FFC: TE 84952-6, 1.0 mm pitch 6-way, ZIF slide-lock, right angle, bottom contact, 2.56 mm tall x 7.3 mm deep, underside. Rated 1 A/contact, 200 V, -40..85 C (TE spec 108-1393 via DigiKey); takes 0.30 mm FPC/FFC with >=3.8 mm backing. Pin order 1 CANL, 2 CANH, 3 GND, 4 VIN_PAD (24 V), 5 YAW_OUT1, 6 YAW_OUT2 - the GND/VIN pair sits between CAN and the PWM motor pair as the guard (COL-COTS-0038; mirrored 2026-08-27 for routing). J1/J12 pads stay as the fallback. DigiKey A101387CT-ND, distributor stock."
			(at 152.4 63.5 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
